# 3. COMPLETE BUSINESS LOGIC

## 3.1 Ownership Model

Each VPN resource must have an identifiable ownership chain.

The system must distinguish:

- External panel ownership.
- Server ownership within Veylix.
- Resource inventory ownership.
- Admin allocation.
- Client assignment.
- Purchase records.

Enforce the ownership chain in every backend operation.

## 3.2 Free VPN

Free VPN resources must be selectable and manageable by Super Admin.

Super Admin must be able to:

- Tag resources as FREE.
- Enable or disable free offers.
- Set available inventory.
- Control eligibility.
- Inspect free claims.
- Prevent unauthorized duplicate allocation.

Free VPN eligibility and claim limits must follow explicitly approved policy.

## 3.3 Premium VPN

Premium resources must support:

- Product name.
- Description.
- Protocol.
- Server.
- Inbound.
- Traffic limit.
- Expiry duration.
- Price.
- Availability.
- Purchase status.
- Assignment history.

